.TH WORDCOUNT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B wordCount()
function reads the file stream pointed to by
.I file
and counts the number of lines, words, and characters, storing the results in
.I lines,
.I words,
and
.I chars
respectively.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, or \-1 on failure.
